      <species id="mwcaeb71d1_a921_41d5_989e_cde7ab963ed0" name="IL12" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Concentration of IL-12 in tumor</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw2cc60432_86fb_4ff5_8805_4d72d3219167" name="IL10" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Concentration of IL-10 in tumor</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw463818af_604b_46a5_9793_2d5832b40dfd" name="qPSC" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Quiescent pancreatic stellate cells in tumor compartment. In normal pancreas, PSCs store vitamin A and maintain stromal homeostasis.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwa05d29f8_7aa9_42c6_b0d5_073759c84529" name="iCAF" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Inflammatory cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete IL-6 and CCL5, driving MDSC recruitment and M2 polarization. Driven by tumor-derived IL-1alpha; TGFb antagonizes via IL-1R1 repression.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw3b2105ec_bf6c_4f23_857f_e1a40e67184c" name="myCAF" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Myofibroblastic cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete ECM, CXCL12, TGFb, VEGF. Build desmoplastic barrier. Favored by TGFb signaling (Biffi 2019).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw1b8daf58_5438_4ff2_a6ac_ab386e2f0495" name="apCAF" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Antigen-presenting cancer-associated fibroblasts. Express MHC-II, present tumor antigen tolerogenically -&gt; Treg induction. Rarest subtype ~2-5% of CAFs (Elyada 2019).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwe60766b4_f4ae_4766_9ad8_160d10abefec" name="collagen" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWBUILTINPREFIX_milli_MWBUILTINUNIT_gram" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Fibrillar collagen (types I/III) in tumor (total mass in mg). Primary structural ECM component driving desmoplasia. Determines pore size (immune exclusion) and stiffness (mechanotransduction).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwa12cad85_39cb_48cc_96b7_e0d2760aa338" name="CXCL12" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">CXCL12/SDF-1 chemokine secreted by iCAFs. Major T cell exclusion mechanism in PDAC via CXCR4 signaling (Elyada 2019, Ogawa 2021).</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mwd8288fc5_3ef6_4380_b6b9_db850bbca0b6" name="IL6" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-6 inflammatory cytokine secreted by iCAFs. Promotes MDSC recruitment, M2 polarization, tumor progression.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mwf6648166_eb20_403c_93c0_93c9fbffa585" name="IL1" compartment="mwaac2231e_8bef_4002_8295_dc35ad09b1d9" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-1alpha in tumor compartment. Tumor-derived; drives iCAF formation via NF-kB/LIF/JAK-STAT3. TGFb antagonizes signaling by downregulating IL-1R1.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw652dd331_2d69_45be_b260_b6f71f61e52e" name="nCD4" compartment="mwffae5ee9_a7cc_4aa4_8aab_e21078e7fd3a" initialAmount="155.689655172414" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
